      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُنْتُقٌ</span></b>  <i>A</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَان</span> <i>of the way</i> or <i>road;</i> (Ibn-'Abbád,
O, K;) a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُنْدُقٌ</span> [q. v.]; disapproved
by El-Khafájee; but heard by Fr from a desertArab of Kudá'ah, as meaning <i>a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُنْدُق</span>, i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَان</span>.
